From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Verzol <giangtuanminh2703@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:25:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Keep fan alert windows and draw AML members from active
 accounts

- FanInTypology, FanOutTypology: drop the startStep override that moved
  the first step near 0 while keeping endStep; fan alerts now use the
  5-20 step window chosen by the generator.
- transaction_graph_generator.py: add _sample_active_members() and
  _has_reliable_normal_activity(); add_aml_typology() draws members from
  accounts that make normal transactions, so mules have a history
  before the illicit flow.

Modified by EarlyMule-TG (thesis project), based on 7338a4b.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
